rgy — Notices
=============

Lineage
-------
rgy merges three prior projects into one workspace:

- `fsearch` (Rust) — name indexing, fuzzy ranking, and the query engine in
  `crates/name-core` (name_index, name_query, fuzzy, live, content). MIT
  licensed; its license text and copyright remain in force for that code.
- the `zen` project (this workspace's `zen-rs`, `search-ui`,
  `discovery-windows`, and `name_core::index`) — Windows NTFS discovery,
  the ERI2 index format, and the terminal UI. Apache-2.0 only here; see
  COPYING.
- `rgx` — the content-search engine, adapters, and Tesla Valve pack store
  in `crates/rgx-*`. Dual MIT OR Apache-2.0 except the TV pack store,
  which is Apache-2.0 only (as upstream marks it).

Ideas, protocols, and behavioral parity (query syntax, rg-compatible
flags, on-disk format layouts) are not code and are not subject to
copyright. Named projects are referenced nominatively; no affiliation is
implied.

